{#- A cake's card on tartor.html: the archive's recipe card (recipe-card.njk) with the drawing of the
    whole cake on a coloured ground where that has the photo, as the pasta sorts' cards have theirs
    (the photos are on the recipe and on its card in the archive). Then the cake's number
    as a badge like the recipe's (.mini-badge), its level's icon and name and, on the right, its
    origin's flag above the title, and what it is built
    with as the chips. The flag's alt text and tooltip are the origin's name; an origin without a flag
    (Latinamerika) shows its name there instead. The title opens the recipe in the recipe dialog, as on
    the archive's cards (data-open, app.js).
    The data attributes are what the filter and the search compare (src/js/tartor.js): data-niva,
    -del and -ursprung are named after the filter's fields, which are also the query string. data-del
    is a list, separated by spaces, and data-ursprung is the region of the cake's origin (Europa for
    Sverige), which the origin menu offers; the search also has the origin itself.
    `item` is an item of collections.cakes (lib/cakes.js). -#}
{%- macro cakeCard(item, base) -%}
{%- set recipe = item.data.recipe -%}
{%- set cake = item.data.tarta -%}
{%- set level = recipe.facts['Nivå'] -%}
{%- set region = cake.ursprung | cakeRegion -%}
<article class="archive-card cake-card" data-niva="{{ level }}" data-del="{{ cake.delar | join(' ') }}" data-ursprung="{{ region }}" data-search="{{ recipe.title }} {{ cake.ursprung }} {{ region }}{% for part in cake.delar %} {{ cakeParts[part].label }}{% endfor %}">
          <div class="archive-card-art cake-card-art">
            <img src="{{ base }}assets/icons/tartor/{{ item.fileSlug }}.svg" alt="" width="512" height="512" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <span class="archive-time">{{ recipe.timeLabel }}</span>
            <button class="favorite" data-save="{{ recipe.id }}" aria-label="Spara {{ recipe.title }}" aria-pressed="false"><i class="far fa-heart" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
          </div>
          <div class="archive-card-body">
            <p class="archive-meal-type"><span class="mini-badge cake-number">Nr {{ cake.nr }}</span><img src="{{ base }}assets/icons/{{ cakeLevels[level] }}.svg" alt="" width="20" height="20">{{ level }}{% if cakeFlags[cake.ursprung] %}<img class="cake-flag" src="{{ base }}assets/icons/flag-{{ cakeFlags[cake.ursprung] }}.svg" alt="{{ cake.ursprung }}" title="{{ cake.ursprung }}" width="22" height="17">{% else %}<span class="cake-flag">{{ cake.ursprung }}</span>{% endif %}</p>
            <h3><a class="recipe-main-link" href="{{ base }}recept/{{ recipe.id }}.html" data-open="{{ recipe.id }}">{{ recipe.title }}</a></h3>
            <p class="archive-description">{{ recipe.description }}</p>
            {%- if cake.delar.length %}
            <div class="ingredient-chips">{% for part in cake.delar %}<span>{{ cakeParts[part].label }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>
            {%- endif %}
          </div>
        </article>
{%- endmacro %}
